-- ============================================================================
-- manual_seed_bank_infm_detl.sql
--
-- ⚠️  MANUAL DBA EXECUTION ONLY — DO NOT AUTO-RUN.
--
--   * This file is intentionally placed under db/manual/, NOT under
--     db/migration/.  It is NOT a Flyway migration and must never be moved
--     into the migration folder.  Flyway is disabled in this project
--     (ddl-auto: validate; Flyway removed 2026-06-10) — nothing here runs at
--     application startup.
--   * A DBA must execute this script by hand against the target database,
--     after confirming the schema (the bank_infm_detl table) already exists.
--   * Idempotent: re-running is safe — ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING skips rows that
--     already exist.  No UPDATE / overwrite of existing rows.
--
-- Purpose
--   Seeds BANK_INFM_DETL — per-bank login-form / detail config (labels, image
--   paths, URLs, password-policy values) keyed by bank_cd + bank_detl_info_cd +
--   seq_no — empty on a fresh refactor database.
--
-- Load order (no hard FK)
--   Logically a child of the bank registry (bank_cd).  There is NO foreign-key
--   constraint, so it loads independently; load manual_seed_bank_infm.sql first
--   for consistency.  Encoding: file is UTF-8 — Vietnamese / Korean text and
--   trailing spaces are stored verbatim.  bank_detl_info_cont is NOT NULL but
--   empty string ('') is valid and used for several rows.
--
-- Table / conflict key
--   Table : bank_infm_detl
--   PK    : pk_bank_infm_detl (bank_cd, bank_detl_info_cd, start_date, end_date, seq_no)
--           ← 5-column composite (seq_no is part of the key, hence the same
--           bank_cd + info_cd can appear with seq_no 0 / 1 / 2).
--   NOT NULL : every column.
--   Data  : assembled in chunks (paste was larger than one message).
--           ── Chunk 1: 380 rows, up to bank_cd 11704100 / info_cd 16 / seq 0.
--              (Resume point for chunk 2: 11704100 / info_cd 17.)
--
-- Execution (example — adjust connection + schema to your environment)
--   psql "host=... dbname=... user=..." -v ON_ERROR_STOP=1 \
--        -f manual_seed_bank_infm_detl.sql
--   If your search_path does not include the schema that owns the table,
--   prefix the table name accordingly (e.g. wecmsdevdb.bank_infm_detl).
-- ============================================================================

